<document xmlns="http://cnx.rice.edu/cnxml" xmlns:m="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML">
  <title>4.15.6: Lesson Summary</title>
  <metadata xmlns:md="http://cnx.rice.edu/mdml">
    <md:content-id>m01141</md:content-id>
    <md:title>4.15.6: Lesson Summary</md:title>
    <md:uuid>4ab664db-847a-4cea-9a41-47c42b12cda8</md:uuid>
  </metadata>
  <content>
  <section id="sect-00001"><para id="para-00001">In this lesson, you learned how to:</para>
<list id="list-00001">
  <item>
    Find missing terms in a geometric sequence.
 </item>
</list>
<para id="para-00002">Here are the <emphasis>activities</emphasis> that helped you reach those goals:</para>
<list id="list-00002">
  <item>
    4.15.1: What Are the Patterns?<list id="list-00003">
    <item>
      In this activity, you noticed and wondered about the patterns and characteristics of different sequences. 
   </item>
  </list>
 </item>
  
  <item>
    4.15.2: Using Tables and Graphs to Represent Geometric Sequences <list id="list-00004">
    <item>
      In this activity, you used tables and graphs to recognize a sequence and find the next term. You learned that geometric sequences can get larger or smaller.
   </item>
    <item>
      4.15.2: Self Check 
   </item>
    <item>
      4.15.2: Additional Resources 
   </item>
  </list>
 </item>
 
  <item>
    4.15.3: Complete the Sequence <list id="list-00005">
    <item>
      In this activity, you worked to complete the geometric sequences by filling in the blanks. You used a common ratio to find the pattern to complete the sequence.
   </item>
    <item>
      4.15.3: Self Check 
   </item>
    <item>
      4.15.3: Additional Resources 
   </item>
  </list>
 </item>
 
  <item>
    4.15.4: Connecting the Common Ratio and the Term in a Sequence <list id="list-00006">
    <item>
      In this activity, you summarized what you learned in the lesson by explaining why a sequence is geometric and how you are able to find the next term.
   </item>
  </list>
 </item>
 
</list>
<para id="para-00003">After these activities, you completed the following <emphasis>practice</emphasis>:</para>
<list id="list-00007">
  <item>
    4.15.5: Practice
 </item>
</list>
<section class="checking-in" id="sect-00002"><title>Checking In</title>
  <exercise id="_4213e411-e774-4bdf-b010-5584a938870b" class="multiple-choice"><problem id="prob-00001"><para id="para-00004">On a scale of 1 to 5, how confident do you feel about the learning goals of this lesson?</para></problem><solution id="sol-00001"><para id="para-00005">Nice reflection! You learn more when you take the time to reflect on your thinking.</para></solution></exercise></section></section>
</content>
